dirs-sys without option-ext, which rustic_core (backup(8)'s restic
repositories, ADR 0465) brings through dirs: option-ext is under the
MPL-2.0, which no program of the system may link (kernel/deny.toml), and
dirs-sys uses only its Option::contains, which is a comparison with
Some.

